  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Deadly Sentencing — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>Starting at 6th level, your mastery over <em>Judge’s Gavel</em> has improved. You can now re-summon your gavel as a free action. You can also spend 2 CE to increase the size of the gavel for 1 minute. The damage dice increase by one tier (d8&lt;d10&lt;d12&lt;2d8). As an action, you can swing the enlarged gavel down on a 10 feet diameter square within 5 feet of you, forcing creatures within range to make a Dexterity saving throw or take twice your gavel’s damage.</p>",
